val - 12+ - Ewa Dina, winner of the 2026 JMK Award, directs Theresa Ikoko’s powerful and award-winning story of teenage friendship under fire in Nigeria. ","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":120,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/youngvic/files/3f025c38-c575-4f3f-ac93-d47a25c345b5.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"GIRLS","instanceDates":"22 October-21 November","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/youngvic/files/3f025c38-c575-4f3f-ac93-d47a25c345b5-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"11001ATRSBGDJMQQMCVKRJSQJPSBBHRPT","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-22T20:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-22T19:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-21T20:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-21T20:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_Genre":"Studio","attribute_SupplementaryEvent":false,"attribute_Venue":"The Maria Theatre","attribute_Festival":"","attribute_PriorityBookingPatronsStarts":null,"attribute_PriorityBookingSoulmatesStarts":null,"attribute_PriorityBookingFriendsStarts":null},{"description":"","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\tBuy your <span class=\"ItalicText\">Girls</span>  playtext in advance for £7.50 and save £1.50. Playtexts cost £9 at the venue. You will receive a voucher which you can exchange for your playtext at the box office when you visit the theatre.<span><br/></span><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/youngvic/files/f69295a2-5ea9-4450-a386-7dbed9e3c557.jpg\" /> \r\n</div>","duration":0,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/youngvic/files/f69295a2-5ea9-4450-a386-7dbed9e3c557.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Girls Playtext","instanceDates":"22 October-21 November","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/youngvic/files/f69295a2-5ea9-4450-a386-7dbed9e3c557-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"27201ATMPGJCKNGLLLPMRKRVCVBLCMPLH","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-22T20:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-22T19:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-21T20:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"20